# CODEOWNERS — review routing for $org/$repo.
#
# Every path is owned by $code_owners. GitHub never requests review from a pull request's own
# author, so with a single owner this routes nothing today. It is here so that the day a second
# account is added, review is requested automatically rather than depending on someone remembering
# to create this file. CODEOWNERS cannot be inherited from the organisation's .github repository,
# so each repository carries its own copy.
* $code_owners
